From 9571ef4796c630fd145f26f64749ef0d24208b47 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guild Idler Patch <patch@guild-idler.local>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 02:48:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add level-gap quest chains and raids (Bandits, Ogres,
 Werewolves, Body Snatcher, Hunt-a-Lich/House of Bones, Millbrook/The Loom,
 Black Dragon Nest)

- 7 new quest chains filling identified level gaps (4, 12, 17, 29, 35, 37, 39)
- 3 new raids: Black Dragon Nest (30, standalone), House of Bones (41,
  requires hunt_a_lich), Silence the Loom (43, requires the_loom_beneath,
  the game's first single-encounter raid)
- New RaidDef.successModifier field for raid-level difficulty tuning
  independent of Normal/Heroic/Mythic tiers, wired into RaidManager and
  the DevTool raids schema
- Fixed a pre-existing DevTool gap: raids schema was missing
  requiresChainId despite it being used by two existing raids
- 45 new raid-loot equipment items (base+heroic+mythic) plus 3 new item
  sets (cinderfang, grimward, loom), 7 new chain-reward items
- New Black Dragonling dedicated-egg pet
- guild-idler-status.md updated: corrected stale chain/raid totals
  (19->28 chains, 5->8 raids) and documented all of the above
