+        "difficulty": "epic",
+        "goldMultiplier": 3,
+        "durationMinutes": 1320
+      },
+      {
+        "name": "The Door He Didn't Bother Locking",
+        "flavour": "The ossuary door isn't warded, isn't guarded, isn't hidden -- which either means he doesn't know the guild is close, or means he wants them to walk in exactly like this, on his own schedule instead of theirs.",
