+    ]
+  },
+  {
+    "id": "quiet_in_millbrook",
+    "name": "Quiet in Millbrook",
+    "description": "Every report out of Millbrook says the same unsettling thing in a different way: the town looks fine, sounds fine, and isn't. Flat affect, identical answers from people who've never met, a whole community suddenly agreeing on everything a little too easily.",
